abstract: >-
  A finite signal-world model combining exact multi-atlas coordinates,
  adaptive packet refinement, typed Bayesian operator programs, explicit
  memory, deterministic transition graphs, and active planning.
keywords:
  - exact reconstruction
  - signal processing
  - wavelets
  - polyphase
  - Bayesian inference
  - world model
  - active planning
